* A bare address that is an expression with a macro parameter ($E7E+\1, $E7E+'\1'): absolute
* long, as outside macros and as both Microware assemblers write it (checked with C 3.2's R68,
* 2026-10-16); before, gas's short form (a parameter alone may be a register, so operands with
* one weren't taken as addresses).
* fixed: FIXME
* expect text: 083900000000 0eef 083900000000 0eef 083900000000 0eef 083900000000 0eef
 psect macro_param_absl,0,0,0,0,0
Mq macro
 btst #0,$E7E+'\1'
 endm
Mn macro
 btst #0,$E7E+\1
 endm
 btst #0,$EEF
 Mq q
 Mn 113
 Mn $71
 ends
